# AILab session start

When the user opens this project, asks **what next**, **recap**, **revision**, or starts a **day N** lab session:

1. Read `learner/journal/PROGRESS.md` for last completed day, phase, and next task.
2. Read the linked **chapter revision** under `docs/revision/`.
3. Begin with a **short revision** (5–8 bullets) of the **last completed chapter/day**, then **today’s next day** from `docs/guides/DAILY_30MIN.md`.
4. Runtime: run **`./server.sh`** once per session (Ollama + `lfm3`). API `http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1`.

User entry doc: `OPEN.md`.

This repo is the open roadmap at `github.com/farnodes/AILab`. Shared days live in `curriculum/curriculum.json`. A learner’s checkmarks live in `learner/progress.json` and are not committed.

When **adding or improving days**, chapters, exercises, or submission Q&A, read and follow `.cursor/skills/ailab-curriculum-day/SKILL.md`.
